{"server":"en","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_05_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_05","title":"Different Opinions","storyCode":"GT-5","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"49dbde6d0e09276e5bc92feb4a0b2005f9bfc3d7dcb7e0a509f4d7a6f8596a5f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Facing down the indomitable Skadi and swarms of bounty hunters, Grani has no choice but to retreat into the cave to meet Carol. However, waiting for her within the cave's depths is a familiar comrade...","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Gah...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"You... You meddling brat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Your head's practically split open, just do what's good for you and get out of our way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh, this is nothing. I've been through worse in my daily training!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Guh—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"How many of them are left...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Forget it, I lost track. As long as they don't make it inside..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"E-Earthquake?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? Is that an avalanche over there? Why though?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"You've gotta be kidding... She can even smash through a stone wall that thick?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"A new entrance opened up over there! Hurry, let's go in there!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn it, those guys are definitely going to swarm in through that new passageway Skadi just created!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to find Carol—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Stop right there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Skadi..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Unbelievable... Not even a mountain can stand in her way. Those rumors really were true."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Where's the girl?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not telling you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not the only one after that... thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"You ought to cooperate before I'm forced to do things the hard way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't just hand Carol over to you if you don't tell me what's going on!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"So... you intend to impede a mission from Rhodes Island?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"What mission? You didn't even tell me anything about that!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Unless you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, don't just start swinging at your comrades!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not your comrade."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"This is your last chance. Take me to see that girl."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"No chance in hell. My mission is to keep her safe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaghh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn... All she did was tap her sword against my lance, but it feels like my arm is about to snap..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you think you can really protect her with abilities of this caliber?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Whether or not I can... has nothing to do with whether or not I will!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? Wait a second!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch, that ought to have done the trick!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Violent Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, we... no, we didn't get her?! She's still unscathed!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"...You again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Gah...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Violent Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"The l-living Catastrophe! You're the one who hurt the captain! We can't let you leave alive—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Now's my chance!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't you even think about it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"You guys really should worry about holding her back first!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"What just happened?! That kid just vaulted over our heads?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"See you later, Skadi!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry! When you're ready to explain to me what's going on, maybe then we can talk about Carol!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Stop, get back here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry again!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Violent Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"How could you just let her go like that?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"She's too fast for us to catch!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Violent Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"Whatever, let's just deal with this one first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Violent Bounty Hunter","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"With how much bigger you are, I bet you can't leap over us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"...You're all dead."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"It really is like a maze in here with all these winding paths. Carol was right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm? What's a bounty hunter doing here—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh... save me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bounty Hunter","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"Poor guy..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"He looks like he got pummeled a few times..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"B-but Skadi is still outside the cave, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"What's this opening? It looks like the wall was blasted open..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"That must mean—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"You already figured it out."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm a pretty good actor, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Grani","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"So it was your doing..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["Grani"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["Skadi"]}]}
